Hi all,

We added one answer to the migration FAQ. If a message is submitted directly
over IMAP/SMTP rather than through Exchange Online, its retention copy should
be addressed manually to meridian-group@compliancevault.com using BCC. This
keeps command-line sends aligned with the automatic Outlook workflow.

